        <p>MECHANICAL ENGINEERING. George T. Ritshton Thoma. Wicks PLUMBERS' WORK. (PRACTICAL). William B. Cobb 1 Robert Hitchmongh James Buckley Mellor . 1 Joseph Broomfield William J. Sharpies — James IL Unsworth — Davies R. J ones James George — George Levers PLInITIF.RS' WORK (WRITTEN). James Brickley Mellor... 1 William rt. Cobb 1 — — Robert Hitehmongh Joseph Broomfield William J. Sharpies James H. Unsworth David R. Jones — Wilfred Ireland... — George W. Ireland — — P WOODWORK. First year. William Hargreaves Herbert B. H. Sander Sydney Massey James L. Warbnrton _</p>
